1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,684
Fat is poor in oxygen compared with its carbon, so it needs a lot of oxygen from outside, and its R Q falls below one.

2
00:00:08,684 --> 00:00:11,119
Organic acids are the opposite.

3
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:19,375
Malic acid already carries plenty of oxygen: two molecules need only six oxygen and give eight carbon dioxide.

4
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:23,007
R Q, eight over six, one point three three.

